---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - MatchTrip" description="MatchTrip privacy policy. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.">
  <Navbar />

  <section class="legal-page">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="last-updated">Last updated: July 28, 2026</p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>MatchTrip is a static informational website. We do not require user accounts or collect personal information directly. When you click affiliate links to third-party booking sites, those sites may collect data according to their own privacy policies.</p>

      <h2>2. Cookies &amp; Analytics</h2>
      <p>We use Google Analytics 4 (GA4) to understand how visitors use our site. GA4 uses cookies to collect usage data such as page views, outbound clicks, and approximate geographic region. We do not collect personally identifiable information.</p>
      <p>The cookies we use include <code>_ga</code> (2 years) and <code>_ga_&lt;container-id&gt;</code> (2 years) for visitor differentiation. You can disable cookies in your browser settings, or use Google's <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener noreferrer">opt-out browser add-on</a>.</p>

      <h2>3. Affiliate Links</h2>
      <p>Some links on MatchTrip are affiliate links. If you make a purchase through these links, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. We only recommend products and services we believe are relevant to sports travel planning.</p>

      <h2>4. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>Our site links to third-party services including Google Hotels, Google Flights, Viator, Google Analytics, and various event ticketing platforms. We are not responsible for their privacy practices.</p>

      <h2>5. Data Security</h2>
      <p>We take reasonable measures to protect any data collected through our site. However, no method of transmission over the Internet is 100% secure.</p>

      <h2>6. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated date.</p>

      <h2>7. Contact</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, please contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@matchtrip.com">hello@matchtrip.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 100px 0 80px;
  }
  .container {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #111;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .last-updated {
    color: #9ca3af;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #111;
    margin: 32px 0 12px;
  }
  p {
    color: #4b5563;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  a {
    color: #6366f1;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
